"P256812101" "According to Jimmy the Preacher, Mickey 'The Magic Man' Maloney is heading to a cargo ship anchored in Independence Port with the intention of blowing it up. That cargo ship belongs to a shipping company that is run by the Tsoo. I'm sure you can imagine how bad this situation could get. <color orange>Get on that ship and stop the Magic Man.</color>"
