"P4011449713" "You find another note taped to the door and signed by the Magic Man.<br><br>'{HeroName}, I didn't have time to plant the fifth bomb this time, so I'm sure you're happy about that. You're welcome. I'm sure Big Tony spilled his guts, again, so I'll see you on Talos Island, only this time, we end this dance.'<br><span align=right>-The Magic Man</span>"

