// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYINFO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1383316457" "Big Tony is one of Jimmy the Preacher's most trusted lieutenants. Whether that is because he is one of Jimmy's cousins, or because Jimmy has no reservations about letting Tony take the fall for him is unclear.<br><br>Either way, Big Tony is well known for being able to handle himself in a fight, and delights in beating people to a pulp with his bare hands."

