"P3060409447" "Mickey 'The Magic Man' Maloney"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYINFO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2095605931" "Mickey Maloney was just a buttonman working for Jimmy the Preacher until he got his hands on the Devil's Timepiece. The ability to shift one's self through time enabled Maloney to rise above his station and change his destiny. With his new found power, Mickey Maloney became a terror for the Tsoo, and proved to be completely unstoppable. Jimmy recognized talent when he saw it and so promoted Maloney to be his right hand man. Mickey Maloney had become, 'The Magic Man'."

